      "answer": "$y=x+2-\\frac{\\pi}{2}$",
      "claim": "D(1-cos(t), pi/2)/D(t-sin(t), pi/2) == 1 ;; SUB(1-cos(t), pi/2) == SUB(t-sin(t), pi/2) + 2 - pi/2"
